position: bottom, 
[
Neighbour-joining tree of eight vertebrate p53 orthologues, built from BLOSUM62 distances over the MAFFT alignment and rooted at its midpoint. Branch labels are bootstrap support from 100 resampled replicates. The fish clade, the mouse--rat pair and the human--tree shrew pair are each recovered in every replicate, while the branching order among the remaining mammals is supported in fewer than a third of them.
]), 
