Distribution of GC content across the 20,000 R1 reads (bars) against the binomial expectation for 150 independent draws at the genome's own GC content of 31.7% (line). The observed distribution is unimodal and matches the expectation, which is what an uncontaminated library from a single organism looks like.
]), 
