Volcano plot of the pasilla analysis. Each point is a gene; the dashed lines mark an adjusted p-value of 0.05 and a two-fold change. The labelled gene FBgn0261552 is pasilla itself, the target of the RNAi knockdown, which the analysis recovers as strongly down-regulated without being told to look for it.
]), 
