The total of 1,182 nucleotides is the check that matters: it equals the length of the CDS feature in the bundled GenBank record, and therefore 393 amino acids plus a stop codon. If the two disagreed, the coordinates would be from a different transcript and every codon number below would be wrong.

#block[
