Allele-frequency membership attack on simulated data. Left: the test statistic of #ref(<eq-14-homer>, supplement: [Equation]) for 200 individuals who contributed to the published pool and 200 who did not, computed from 5,000 markers; the dashed line is a threshold set three standard deviations above the mean of the non-contributors. Right: the proportion of contributors detected at that threshold as a function of the number of markers used, with the false-positive rate among non-contributors.
