The analysis needs only the bundled genome, the bundled annotation and Prodigal, which is pinned in the book's `environment.yml`. Intermediate files are written to a scratch directory so that rendering the book leaves nothing behind; in the real project they would go to `results/`, as described in #ref(<sec-15-structure>, supplement: [Section]).

