Why the first run failed. Left: the number of in-frame TGA codons per reference coding sequence; under genetic code 11 each of these terminates translation. Right: the percentage of reference coding sequences whose stop coordinate the code 11 prediction recovered, split by whether the gene contains an internal TGA. Genes without one are recovered almost perfectly; genes with one are recovered barely half the time.
