Agreement between Prodigal predictions and the RefSeq annotation of #emph[M. genitalium] G37, under the default bacterial genetic code and under the code the organism actually uses. Sensitivity is the percentage of the 524 reference coding sequences whose stop coordinate and strand were predicted; precision is the percentage of predictions matching a reference stop.
